Differences compared to the ellipsis package:

- Use r-lib bullets formatting in error messages
- Added `check_dots_empty0()` as a more efficient variant of `check_dots_empty()` for low level functions. Marked as internal since it's mostly meant for rlang and vctrs.

```r
f <- function(x, ..., y) {
  check_dots_empty()
  NULL
}
g <- function(x, ..., y) {
  if (!missing(...)) {
    check_dots_empty()
  }
  NULL
}
h <- function(x, ..., y) {
  check_dots_empty0(...)
  NULL
}

bench::mark(f(), g(), h())[1:8]
